OL,3,GNEWSACity market set to move after 30
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's weekly market is set to move
OL,7,Flocation after 30 years following news
OL,8,Fa new provider was found for it.
OL,10,FThe market in Worcester had been set up
OL,11,Fin Angel Place, but it will relocate to
OL,12,FCorn Market from September, taking
OL,13,Fplace on Thursdays and Saturdays.
OL,15,FA new operator, Bluebell Events, will
OL,16,Frun the market between 09:00 and 16:00
OL,17,FBST, after Cotswold Markets decided to
OL,18,Fstop providing it.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
