OL,3,GNEWSACity market set to move after 30
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are committed to giving Worcester a
OL,7,Fhigh-quality weekly market that
OL,8,Fsupports the city's enterprise and
OL,9,Fcreates a true destination for
OL,10,Fvisitors," Bluebell Events' Chloe Ford
OL,11,Fsaid.
